  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">V&#xe4;rldstullorganisationen WCO Columbusprogr 2008-12</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WCO (World Customs Organization) Columbus 2008-12 - WCO Columbus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till modernisering och effektivisering av            tulladministrationer regionalt i Afrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara. De regioner  som ing&#xe5;r i implementeringsfasen 2010-2012 &#xe4;r EAC, SACU, ECOWAS samt  en bilateral komponent som blivit kvar fr&#xe5;n tiden innan den regionala relevansen f&#xf6;r insatsen definierades.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to promote sustainable customs modernisation through implementation of the WCO framework of Stadards to Secure and         Facilitate Global Trade (SAFE) by developing an effective,            professional and transparent customs service capable of achieving an  appropriate balance between the collection of satisfactory revenue,   protection from illicit activity and facilitating trade.</narrative>
  </description>
